  "title": "Crispy Basket Burritos (Baked Tortilla Bowls)",
  "description": "Crispy, crunchy baked tortilla bowls are easy to make at home with less grease than fried! Fill them with your favorite taco salad or burrito fixings.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-09-22T21:19:38-04:00",
